## Pickups balance
category big-armor-defense: HardlightShell;       # 200 armor, 100% damage reduction.
category big-armor: DynamicArmor;                 # 100 armor, 75% damage reduction.

## Powerups Orbs

category big-defense: Overlord Overhaul;          # Invulnerability; killed enemies revive as allies.
category big-attack-defense: Overdrive Overkill;  # 2x damage dealt, 1/4 damage taken; makes enemies explode on death and reduces damage taken from fire-type explosions.
category Big-attack-ammo: Overcharge Overload;    # Overcharges your melee weapon by 100% ammo; grants temporary infinite ammo.

category big-armor-health: Overflow;              # 100% extra armor and hp.
category big-health: Medicant;                    # 100% extra hp.
category big-armor: Aegis;                        # 100% extra armor.

category medium-attack: Accelerate;               # Increase speed and rate of fire.
category medium-defense: Siphon Recluse Anima;    # Drains damage dealt to enemies; turns you invisible (like a Blur Sphere); lets you survive death.
category medium-attack-defense: Manic;            # Decreases damage taken and increases damage dealt by 50% each.

category maprevealer: Geoscanner;
category tool: ImmersionSuit FluxGoggles;

## These give a small stat boost and increase the maximum by 5%. They also stack permanently.
category upgrade-health: VitalityTonic;
category upgrade-armor: ArmorAugmenter;
category upgrade-ammo: SuppAmmoSatchel;

